WEBVTT

title
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.600
Rooftop Solar Connection Simulator
VR training · Unity · archival headset gameplay capture

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:10.350
A narrated welcome and a mission briefing open the session.

2
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.750 line:8%
Narrated steps guide the learner, starting with personal protective equipment.

3
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:21.250 line:8%
Point, hold and place each PPE item onto the body.

4
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:27.250
On the rooftop, the three panels are tested one by one.

5
00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:35.450
Tool tasks: a clamp meter measures each panel's current.

6
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:43.250
Wiring: positive cables to the female Y connector, negative to the male.

7
00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:47.150
Rooftop wiring complete; the task tablet then leads the learner downstairs.

8
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:54.950
Downstairs: the PCU and two batteries. Each battery is tested first.

9
00:00:55.150 --> 00:01:09.450 line:8%
Multimeter checks, then a loop cable joins the 12 V batteries in series for 24 V.

10
00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:17.950 line:8%
This run shows the failure branch: the battery is wired with the wrong polarity.

11
00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:26.650
The virtual PCU is destroyed and the learner is told to repeat the step.

